00:00:46.213 --> 00:00:49.550 size:53% position:73% line:53%
JOELLE MALEK, infirmière

00:00:47.414 --> 00:00:50.784 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Institut de recherche du CUSM

00:00:48.649 --> 00:00:51.985 size:53% position:73% line:53%
